        "defaultValue": "Battery Saving"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Redrawing the display less often while a long way from zero conserves battery and functionality. Up or down reveals the exact time (single-second Peek on timer, or Split for stopwatch)."
