        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Instant Start"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Optionally, start timing the moment the app opens or is reset, rather than when you finish editing/confirming. You enable it by configuring the time window allowed to begin setting a timer after app opening/reset (otherwise stopwatch auto-starts)."
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "messageKey": "instantStart",
